<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch AEX index hits 900 points for first time.</title>
<headline>Dutch AEX index hits 900 points for first time.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The AEX index of 25 Dutch blue chip shares hit the 900-point mark for the first time on Thursday.</p>
<p>The index extended earlier gains following benign U.S. payrolls data and was up over 20 points or two percent in late trade at 900.43.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
